{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48902","headline":"惜莲花 · 崔橹","name":"惜莲花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半塘前日染来红，瘦尽金方昨夜风。\n留样最嗟无巧笔，护香谁爲惜熏笼。\n缘停翠櫂沈吟看，忍使良波积渐空。\n魂断旧溪顦顇态，冷烟残粉楚台东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}